SUMMARY:Gaza Square - by Davenport 4 Palestine
LOCATION:371 Wallace Ave
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DJxlzwhNpo7/\n\nHosted
  by Davenport 4 Palestine
  (https://www.instagram.com/davenport4palestine/)\n\nDaveport 4 Palestine
  invites you to come hang out at Gaza square on Sunday mornings with hot
  chocolate and coffee\, buttons and posters\, lawn signs and colourful
  chalk. Come say hi and meet your fellow neighbours/organizers as they
  make their presence known and continue to build safety in their
  community!
END:VEVENT
