 ’ve got company. In the new action-packed chapter from the best-selling 
 book series by Aaron Blabey about a crackerjack crew of animal outlaws\, o
 ur now-reformed Bad Guys are trying (very\, very hard) to be good\, but in
 stead find themselves hijacked into a high-stakes\, globe-trotting heist\,
