 ves.​\nFood allergy notice: Please be aware that food will be used in th
 is program.  Certain food ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some
  people.​\nThis is an in person program for Teens. Registration is requi
 red.\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Pu
 blic Library under the\nPublic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, an
 d 20(d). The information will only be used for\nevent and program registra
 tion\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library\nhandles y
 our information can be directed to Answerline staff at answerline@tpl.ca\,
  416-397-\n5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
