UID:6994be3b6724c63d00f34c64@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wished you could fly like a bird or hover like a
  dragonfly? Let’s explore all the extraordinary animals that fly. Learn 
 about birds by identifying their unique calls. Analyze the characteristics
  of different insect wings. Mimic how animals soar by experimenting with a
  glider. Create a butterfly* and discover how they move their bodies. Join
  us as we investigate the many wonderful creatures with wings.\nRegistrati
 on is required. Please register online or call the branch at 416-393-7700.
 \nRegistration begins Monday\, February 23.\n*Possible allergen: Plasticen
 e is used in this workshop.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under 
