SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Ping Pong Tournament
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260317T190000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260317T210000Z
UID:699de2968b29ea2800d2289a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Compete in a fast-paced ping pong tournament\, battling it out
  in exciting head-to-head matches. Players will test their reflexes\, stra
 tegy\, and spin skills for prizes and ultimate bragging rights.\nThis prog
 ram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for tee
 ns after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always availab
 le. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\
