DESCRIPTION:Come join us on a Safari Adventure and meet a variety of anima
 ls from around the globe! Animals *may include\, a bunny\, guinea pig\, fe
 rret\, hedgehog\, bearded dragon\, other lizard species\, smaller snake\, 
 smaller tortoise\, and a parrot. This event allows up to 30 participants i
 n total (including adults). *Exact animals will be named day of program to
  make sure those that come out are in a good mood and are feeling ready to
  socialize.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on t
 his form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libra
 ries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only b
 e used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Quest
 ions about how the library handles your information can be directed to Ans
 werline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, 
 Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
