SUMMARY:Group Swim: Partitioning - Q&A
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Postgres\nLooking for practical database support without the cost? Group Swim: PostgreSQL Edition – Partitioning is an opportunity to explore real-world partitioning strategies with guidance from Postgres experts. Bring your use cases\, questions\, and challenges to better understand when and how partitioning can improve performance and manageability.
