SUMMARY:Hands-On Dinosaur Fossils and Acient Life
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T150000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T160000Z
UID:699f63d14a9fd98b7f808638@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an opportunity to handle\, examine up close and di
 scuss nine real and replica fossils in this fascinating hands-on workshop.
  Participants will be entertained and educated\, not just about the fossil
 s themselves\, but the palaeontological aspects that underpin them. Concep
 ts include: evolution\, fossilization\, ‘The Tree of Life’ (phylogeny)
  and — of course — dinosaurs!
LOCATION:Beaches\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699f63d14a9fd98b7f808638
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
