DESCRIPTION:Get ready to shout\nBINGO!\nAt your favorite place — the Dow
 nsview Library!\nJoin us for a fun-filled\nKids Bingo Games Day\npacked wi
 th laughter\, prizes\, and exciting challenges!\nWhat to Expect:\nColorful
  bingo cards made just for kids\nAwesome prizes for winners\nA special bon
 us round with BIG surprises!\nPerfect for kids. Parents are welcome to joi
 n the fun too!\nFree to attend — just sign up on our website or call the
  branch to reserve your spot!\nDon’t miss out — the next number called
  could be yours!\nSee you at BINGO!\nFor children ages 6-12\n. Registrati
 on Required.\nTo register for this program\, please contact Downsview Libr
 ary\, or visit our website.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal 
 information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under 
 the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The informa
 tion will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and e
 valuation. Questions about how the library handles your information can be
  directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789
  Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.\nDue to the nature of this program\, w
 e cannot accommodate large groups\, daycares\, and day camps.
LOCATION:Downsview\, Downsview Library Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/699a1f5eb48451fc3c043ac1
