SUMMARY:Scientists in the School: Invesitgate It
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T190000Z
UID:699f28be8089f23c675e17b1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Become a Forensic scientist and investigate this whodunit by e
 xamining clues left at the scene!  Learn how to interpret evidence by exp
 loring fabric samples and running chemical analysis on a mystery solution.
 \nCome join us for this great Investigate It\, Whodunit workshop
LOCATION:Long Branch\, Program Room
