SUMMARY:'Project Hail Mary' Advanced In-Person Screening with The Sci Fi Book Club
DESCRIPTION:The Sci Fi Book Club\nHey everyone!\n\nWe've just been invited to an advanced screening of *Project Hail Mary* at the AMC Empire 25 in NYC. [Book Club read the novel back in 2022](https://www.meetup.com/thescifibookclub/events/288014941)\, and might be my favorite Andy Weir novel. When we discussed it\, we had a hard time casting the main character. The snark\, the smarts\, the dramatic gravitas. I think Gosling has what it takes! Come watch with us on the 18th.\n\n[You'll find the trailer for Project Hail Mary here.](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P0XN3-n-2Lo)\n\n**Summary**\nScience teacher Ryland Grace (Ryan Gosling) wakes up alone on a spaceship with no memory of who he is or why he’s there. As his memories return\, he realizes he’s on a mission to save the Sun and a dying Earth.\n\n**RSVP to the event here AND ALSO register via the link below.**\nConfirm on Meetup AND ALSO click through the link below to attend. You will make an account with Amazon MGM Studios and can reserve up to 2 seats.\n\nSpace is limited for this screening\; get your passes while they last. The organizers strongly encourage all guests to arrive early\, as it is first-come\, first-served. The doors open at 7:20pm and the film starts at 8pm.\n\n**[Reserve your ticket(s) here.](https://mgmscreenings.com/movie_landing/UEhNLlNC)**\n\nLet me know if you have any questions and see you at the movies!\nCheers\,\nJon
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/thescifibookclub/events/313668180/
