SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Henna Art Workshop with Hina Yasir
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260318T210000Z
UID:69822fe9d2bbe265eb2bed84@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover the art of Henna\, decorative designs which are creat
 ed on a person’s body using a paste of natural organic henna. Observe an
 d enjoy the henna application and learn about its history\, recipe\, and t
 raditions. Led by Henna Artist\, Hina Yasir.\nThis is a drop-in program.\n
