UID:6999d91f5506be0745fe86f2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Leaside Library for a fun afternoon of Sna
 p Circuits!  We’ll celebrate March Break with a Snap Circuit Hackathon! 
  Play with electricity and circuitry during this hands-on program!  Turn o
 n a light\, spin a motor\, and activate a speaker!\nFor ages 6-12.\nDrop-i
 n\, no registration required.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe persona
 l information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library unde
 r the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The infor
 mation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and
  evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information can 
 be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 7
 89 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
