SUMMARY: Scarborough’s Got Jokes presents Listen to This!
DESCRIPTION:Scarborough’s Got Jokes presents Listen to This!\n\nReal stor
 ies. Big laughs. Heartfelt moments.\n\nA comedic storytelling show that b
 rings together storytellers and comedians to tell funny\, true stories on
  the theme Wild Night Out.\n\nJoin us for a special first presentation of
  Listen to This\, a live storytelling show featuring local voices sharing
  comedic\, heartfelt\, and deeply human stories.\n\nFrom laugh-out-loud m
 oments to touching reflections\, this evening brings the community togeth
 er through the power of storytelling — raw\, real\, and unforgettable.\n\
 nEnjoy food and drink specials from Bluffs Pizza while you settle in for 
 an intimate night of stories.\n\nTone: Comedic & heartfelt storytelling\n
 \nAudience: All ages welcome\; content best suited for adult audiences (1
 8+ advised)\n\nBluffs Pizza\n\nThursday\, March 19\n\nShow at 7:00 PM - 8
 :30 (doors open early for food & drinks)\n\nTickets: https://www.jumpcome
 dy.com/e/scarboroughs-got-jokes-presents-listen-to-this https://www.jumpc
