SUMMARY:Friday Brunch! (What is Love?) (with Steve and MJ) (on Zoom) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\nPlease join us for an insightful and interactive event as we dive deeper into understanding the real meaning and demonstration of Love. within in romantic\, intimate and committed relationships.\n\nWe all bring years of knowledge\, wisdom\, stories and even questions' so together we can support\, inspire and share our views on love.\n\nThis will be a well organized\, interactive and a much needed conversation\; so please join us if you can.\n\n\\*I will be hosting this event with a friend (MJ) who is also quite passionate and well spoken on the topic of what is Love?\n\nThanks again everyone!\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
