DESCRIPTION:Curious about watercolor but not sure where to start? Join thi
 s fun\, relaxed\, workshop designed for complete beginners. Move beyond tr
 aditional\, rigid painting and explore a looser\, more expressive style. W
 e’ll focus on fundamental techniques\, including colour blending and tex
 ture\, while encouraging you to embrace "happy accidents" and develop your
  unique style. No experience necessary—just a curiosity to create!\nThis
  program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place fo
 r teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always av
 ailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch wi
 th a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
