SUMMARY: Ukrainian Dumplings Cooking Class
DESCRIPTION:Are you a dumpling lover?\n\nGet ready to roll up your sleeve
 s and dive into the delicious world of Ukrainian dumplings—a fun\, hands-
 on class where you’ll learn to make these tasty treats from scratch. This
  is an in-person event\, perfect for food lovers looking to explore new f
 lavors and cooking skills. Bring your appetite and a friend\, and let's m
 ake some unforgettable dumplings together!\n\nYou can learn to make dumpl
 ings from scratch at our cooking class. Try two fillings: potatoes & mush
 rooms + beef\, garlic & dill.\n\nLearn our unique recipes\, get new skill
 s and enjoy the fruit of your work with craft beer.\n\nConnect with Ukrai
 ne\, its roots and legacy.\n\nLearn to cook like Babcia\n\n21 March\, Sat
 urday\n\n1 PM - 3:30 PM\n\nRainhard Brewing\, 100 Symes road
