SUMMARY:Toronto Babel: Spring Break Edition @ Condo Party Room 
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n**Event Space & Toronto Babel Presents: 🌴 Spring Break — Toronto Edition ☀️**\n\nJoin us for a special Saturday night in our brand new condo party room with two rooms near College St & McCaul St.\n\nSpring is almost here\, and we’re bringing the vacation vibes to you! Think bright shirts\, summer anthems\, and a room full of people ready to kick off spring the fun way as we turn our party room space into a mini Spring Break escape—complete with inflatable beach balls\, tropical fits\, a DJ spinning classic summer throwbacks all night\, and karaoke sing-alongs in the second room. 🌴☀️🎶\n\nSo throw on your loudest floral shirt or most colourful summer fit and come ready for a night of music\, drinks\, and great company.\n\n**✨ What to Expect:**\n🎧 DJ F.L.Ÿ spinning Summer Anthem Classics\n🎤 Karaoke sing-alongs in the second room\n🏖️ Spring Break theme & décor\n🍹 Drinks\, snacks & great social vibes\n\n**🎟️ Tickets:**\n💸 $20 general admission – Includes **1 complimentary alcoholic or non-alcoholic drink**\nAdditional drink tickets will be available for purchase. **No outside alcohol permitted.**\n\nUse Code 'BL05' - Get your tickets here: [https://www.event-space.net/event-details/spring-break-toronto-edition](https://www.event-space.net/event-details/spring-break-toronto-edition)\n\n📍 Location available with online ticket - College St & McCaul St\n\n**📅 Saturday\, March 21**\n**⏰ 6 PM – 11 PM**\n\n**⚠️ Limited capacity — advance tickets required. Our last Lunar Event Sold Out.**\n\nNo flights\, no passports—just Spring Break energy in the heart of Toronto. 🌴🎉
