SUMMARY:Brock Tract Loop in Goodwood must be good!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Meetup Point: *1401 Brock Road\,* Goodwood\, ON L0C 1A0**\n\nThe Brock Tract trail offers a great option for an immersive escape into nature with a well-maintained trail that explores a mix of woodlands and open fields. Located in the Uxbridge Woodlands of Ontario\, this trail is ideal for those looking for a trail that explores the forests and open fields of this area. Along the way\, you'll find a variety of wildlife and enjoy views of the surrounding landscape.\nWear weather appropriate gear please\, which means good hiking shoes that wear well in mud\, slush and snow as we are in the in between weather. Hiking poles would be helpful as well cause it can be slippery at the time of year.\nLots of water and snacks is suggest as this is a 15km loop.\nOnce you are in you are in!
