SUMMARY:Start Spring with Dim Sum at this Top Dim Sum Restaurant (Spadina Ave.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Sunday 22nd March\, start Spring with some yummy Dim Sum.** I have been going to this place for over 20 years\, and have shared with many meetup groups\, so hope you will join us. Rol Sans moved to it's new address almost 2 years ago\, and I am looking forward to this modern location with their endless all-day dim sum menu. Framed pictures of their bestsellers (and also mine) are above. Note: This will be a shared experience at the table.\n\n**COST**\nDim Sum: Cost + Tip + Taxes will be divided equally amongst attendees\n\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes and the system will add you to the wait list\n* To secure your seat\, a $10 etransfer (includes $5 meetup fee) is required to hold a seat at the table. Attendees will receive $5 back at the end of dim sum - there are no refunds for cancellations or no shows.\n* Once you are on the waitlist\, I will message you my email for the etransfer.\n* Once the transfer is complete\, I will move you to attending.\n* A reminder will be sent the night before with my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up your communication settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 11:45am inside the front doors of Rol Sans at 388 Spadina Ave.** Please wait for me to arrive\, and do not sit on your own prior\, so we can get the table requested.\n\nLength: 1 hour 45mins\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments in the event after.
