SUMMARY:Sunday Road Trip to Niagara Falls: Le Grand Cirque – MAXIMUM VELOCITY! $50 total
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n***\n\n🎪🚗 **Sunday Road Trip to Niagara Falls: Le Grand Cirque – MAXIMUM VELOCITY!** 🚗🎪\n\n**Sunday\, March 22**\n\nJoin us for a thrilling Sunday getaway to **Niagara Falls** to experience **Le Grand Cirque: MAXIMUM VELOCITY** — a high-octane\, jaw-dropping spectacle at Fallsview Casino Resort!\n\nTravel together in a comfortable **Kia Soul**\, complete with **snow tires** and **SiriusXM**\, and enjoy a relaxed road trip with great company before an unforgettable afternoon show.\n\nDepending on traffic we may be able to sightsee a bit before the show\n\n***\n\n### ✨ **About the Show**\n\n**Le Grand Cirque: MAXIMUM VELOCITY** is an adrenaline-fueled cirque production packed with gravity-defying acrobatics\, daring aerial acts\, incredible strength performances\, and breathtaking stunts performed by world-class artists. Fast-paced\, visually stunning\, and family-friendly\, this show delivers nonstop excitement from start to finish.\n🔗 **Event details:**\n[https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/le-grand-cirque.html](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/le-grand-cirque.html)\n\n***\n\n### 🕛 **Schedule**\n\n* **12:00 PM (Noon)** – Depart Toronto\n* **3:00 PM** – Show starts\n* **\\~7:00 PM** – Return to Toronto\n\n***\n\n### 🚗 **What’s Included**\n\n* 🎟️ Show ticket\n* 🚘 Round-trip transportation in a Kia Soul\n* 🎶 SiriusXM music for the drive\n\n***\n\n### 💲 **Cost**\n\n**$50 total** (includes ticket and transportation)\n👉 **Payment required in advance**\nPlease e-transfer $50 to: nicolasbello@yahoo.com\nYour spot is confirmed once payment is received.\n\n***\n\nSpace is limited\, so please RSVP **only if you’re fully committed**\, as tickets and transportation are arranged in advance.\nLet’s enjoy a fun Sunday road trip and an electrifying afternoon at the circus! 🎪✨
