SUMMARY:Eric Abramovitz\, clarinet with TSO Strings
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T151500
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T151500
UID:919cebb69ed71601e4c76dee305af133@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:A special treat! Eric has created a program for clarinet and s
 tring quartet\, featuring four of his Toronto Symphony Orchestra (TSO) col
 leagues. \n\nHe has been TSO’s principal clarinet since 2021. A Montreal
  native\, he was named CBC Next! artist in 2013\, Vandoren Emerging Artist
  of the year in 2017\, and was a Sylva Gelber Career Grant recipient in 20
 16. \n\nEric has been featured as a soloist with numerous orchestras inclu
 ding the l’Orchestre symphonique de Québec\, and the NAC Orchestra. Joi
 ning Eric are his colleagues Luri Lee and Kun Yan on violins\, Rémi Pelle
 tier on viola\, and Lucia Ticho on cello. \n\nThe program will feature Ger
 shwin\, Bartok\, Ravel clarinet arrangements along with the virtuosic von 
 Weber Clarinet Quintet in B-flat Major\, Op. 34.\n\nCategories: Cultural\,
  Live Performances\, Music
LOCATION:Walter Hall\, University of Toronto\, 80 Queen's Park\, Toronto\,
  ON\, M5S 2C5
URL:https://www.mooredaleconcerts.com
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
