SUMMARY:White Girls in Moccasins
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260322T193000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T193000
UID:3456a65922958bc8c798fce7ebab6457@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to the anticipated return of this theatrical p
 lay by Yolanda Bonnell to Tkarón:to! \n\nWhite Girls in Moccasins is a lo
 ve letter to brown kids born in the 80s\, surviving in the 90s and all tho
 se continuing to deeply reclaim. \n\nThis is a hilarious and poignant recl
 amation story that world-hops between dreams\, memories\, and a surreal ga
 me show. Miskozi recounts her life and is forced to grapple with her own t
 ruth\, while existing in a society steeped in white supremacy. \nCategorie
 s: Indigenous\, Theatre
LOCATION:Aki Studio\, 585 Dundas St E\, Toronto\, ON\, M5A 2B7
URL:https://nativeearth.ca/shows/all-shows/white-girls-in-moccasins-by-yol
 anda-bonnell
