SUMMARY: The Other Car - Public Reading +
DESCRIPTION:The Other Car - Public Reading+\n\nOptional Movement Workshop
 : 6:15 pm - 7 pm.\n\nPublic Reading: 7:20 pm - 10 pm.\n\n\nAward-winning 
 physical theatre company Falling Iguana Theatre is thrilled to share the 
 first\n\npublic reading of our fourth original production entitled The Ot
 her Car.\n\nWe will be hosting a reading of The Other Car at Society Club
 house in Toronto on Sunday\, March\n\n22nd\, from 7:20 pm to 10 pm. Falli
 ng Iguana Theatre will be inviting seven super talented actors\n\nto read
  our newest play and we'd love for you to come and hear this play for the
  very first time!\n\nThere will also be some fun FIT merch and maybe some
  free stuff too! The Society Clubhouse is\n\na women-owned event space in
  the heart of Toronto's West End with a great vibe and a\n\nrenowned tapr
 oom- so yes\, there's booze at this thing!\n\n\nWHAT'S THAT + SIGN FOR?\n
 \nMovement workshop: 6:`15 pm to 7 pm.\n\nAs part of the evening's festiv
 ities\, Falling Iguana Theatre will be offering an optional* movement\n\n
 workshop to introduce how we build movement for our productions to any in
 terested\n\nparticipants. It’ll be fun\, affordable\, and stress-free\, w
 ith no experience required!\n\n*You do not need to attend the workshop to
  attend the reading\, and vice versa!
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Spoken-Word/Poetry,Society-Clubh
 ouse,Workshop
