UID:event_313333526@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260316T061713Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260323T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260323T143000
SUMMARY:Model Mondays - Open Models with Fireworks AI & Microsoft Foundry Tools
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nPartner Spotlight - Running Open Models at Scale: Fireworks AI on Microsoft Foundry\nChoosing a model is easy. Scaling it reliably is the hard part. In this Model Mondays session\, join **Shaunak Godbole**\, Field CTO at Fireworks AI\, for interactive demos and a deeper look at how developers can run best‑in‑class open models at scale without managing infrastructure\, including bringing the models they already trust through bring‑your‑own‑weights with Fireworks on Microsoft Foundry.\n\nTech Spotlight - Microsoft Foundry Tools & MCP\nThe Foundry Tools provide a central hub for agents to discover and integrate tools (MCP Servers) to extend their capabilities. Join **SeokJin Han** as he demonstrates Foundry Tools and the Model Context Protocol integration. Learn how agents can discover and utilize tools through MCP Servers\, extending their capabilities with a standardized interface and growing ecosystem.\n\n----------------------------------------------\n[Explore the repo](https://github.com/microsoft/model-mondays/blob/main/docs/model-mondays/2026-03-23-s03-e14.md)\n\n📢 [Join the conversation on Discord!](https://aka.ms/model-mondays/discord)\n\n📌 This session is a part of the Model Mondays series. [Learn more here!](https://developer.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1485/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1485_webpage_reactor)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/313333526/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260213T003618Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260213T003618Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/4/2/b/600_532918411.jpeg
END:VEVENT
