DESCRIPTION:Are you an avid reader? If reading more is one of your goals t
 his year\, then the Teen Book Club might be the place for you. Every month
  we will read a book that aligns with TPL’s Reading Challenge for an add
 ed twist! When the year is finished\, enter the contest\, or take simply b
 e proud of yourself for reading. Drop by the Youth Hub to pick up the rec
 ommended title or simply join us to talk about all things bookish.\nAll te
 ens are welcome! This month we'll focus on two categories:\na book about
  warm weather and a book about cold weather.\nThis program is part of Yout
 h Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and
  in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutriti
 ous snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call
