DESCRIPTION:Hosted by comedian and crossword writer Ada Nicolle (Guelph C
 omedy Festival\, 6.9M+ Instagram views @adanicklmao)\, Vibraslap! is your
  next favourite alt-comedy show in Toronto. Ada's chosen some of her favo
 urite stand-up comedians and now you get to see them perform live before 
 they blow up :)\n\nBring a date! Bring your friends! Bring the mayor! Bri
 ng your landlord and you'll have indie cred with your landlord. Have a me
 et-cute in the audience! Stop for shawarma on the way home afterward and 
 still get to sleep at a reasonable time. This sounds like the best night 
 ever! (You're the best at making plans\, y'know\; you always are.)\n\nThi
 s is a queer and trans-friendly comedy show. If Ada is not gay enough for
  you she will get gayer over the course of the show.\n\nWanna know the fu
 ll lineup when it drops? Follow @vibraslapcomedy on Instagram.\nUse SLAP3
 0 for 30% off tickets online.\n\nMonday\, March 23rd @ 8:00 PM\, Comedy B
 ar Bloor\, 945 Bloor St W
