 ling skies. Using sparkling resin “diamonds\,” you’ll bring a vibran
 t masterpiece to life — one shimmering piece at a time.\nThis beginner-f
 riendly activity is perfect for anyone who wants to unwind\, get creative\
 , and leave with a glowing work of art inspired by one of history’s most
  iconic artists. No experience needed — just patience\, focus\, and your
  artistic spirit!\nDrop-in only\, no registration necessary.\nProgram held
  at the Youth Hub.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs 
 are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where hel
 pful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered dai
 ly. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out mo
 re.
