DESCRIPTION:Join\nTV host and celebrity chef Sang Kim\nfor a hands-on sush
 i-making experience made just for teens!\nLearn to roll sushi with fresh\,
  chef-prepped ingredients—and eat what you make. You’ll also learn som
 e fun facts about sushi history and the do’s and don’ts of eating sush
