SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260316T061706Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260328T174000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260328T203000
SUMMARY:Sleeping Beauty Ballet of Lights in a Sparkling Show (Front St)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: Seats became available this morning and will sell out\, so purchase your ticket asap.\n\nOn **Saturday March 28th\,** **see the new Ballet of Lights Sleeping Beauty in a Sparkling Show.** This beloved tale is brought to life through classical dance\, stunning choreography and beautiful glow-in-dark costumes. Six incredible local dancers light up the stage in costumes that transform every moment in a radiant display. I am seated in Zone C. **Purchase: Ballet of Lights Sleeping Beauty in a Sparkling Show on Saturday March 28th at 6pm (be careful as there are other dates and time slots on the same day).**\n\n**COST**\nRegular: Adults $30 - 84 + taxes + fees\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, no refunds or exchanges.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes** **(everyone goes on the waitlist until they post they purchased their tickets)**\n* **[Purchase](https://feverup.com/m/396867?utm_source=fever_app_share&utm_medium=plan_detail&utm_campaign=396867_yyz&ref=ISABELM84996)**[ ](https://tickets.mirvish.com/tina/20416)your own ticket by selecting Tickets\, March 28th\, 6pm (caution there are multiple dates and times)\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 1 day prior and the Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 5:40pm** **inside the front doors of Young People's Theatre at 165 Front St. E**\n\n**Show Starts: 6pm (there is no late entry)**\n\nLength: 60 mins\n\nAfter: I'll drive us to dinner at a restaurant nearby\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the Event after.
