UID:event_313712096@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260316T061703Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260329T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260329T110000
SUMMARY:Wild Breath Live on Zoom
DESCRIPTION:High Park Yoga\nI know so many of you enjoy the extended\, rythmic breathwork at the end of my yoga classes. Well\, here is your chance to continue harnessing the power of your breath guided by my patner Steve.\n\n**\\*\\*You must [sign up for free on Calendly via this link](https://calendly.com/breathinginnature/wild-breath) BEFORE the class to receive the Zoom link\\*\\***\n\n### What's the Wild Breath?\n\nOur breath is our most powerful healing tool & the energetic link between our mind\, body\, heart and spirit.\nIn this free\, one hour class guided by Steve live on Zoom you will use your breath to achieve a deep state of meditation and wellbeing. Breathing to the beats of the music\, you unlock the power within you to reduce stress and inflammation\, boost creativity\, release trapped emotions\, gain clarity and return to your true Self.\n\n**What you'll need:**\n\n* [Sign up for free on Calendly via this link](https://calendly.com/breathinginnature/wild-breath) **BEFORE** the class to receive the Zoom link\n* Good quality headphones or stereo system\n* Internet connection\n* A comfortable place to sit or lie down for your breathwork\n\n### Weekly\n\nTuesday 8pm EST\nWednesday 7am EST\nSunday 10am EST
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/high-park-yoga/events/313712096/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260309T145014Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260309T145014Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/8/7/600_530341671.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Toronto Wellness": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-wellness-yoga-art-therapy-meditation-chakra/events/313712494/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_wellness
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Wellness
UID:event_313712494@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260316T061704Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260329T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260329T110000
SUMMARY:Vipassana Meditation & Pranayama | Clear Mind & Emotional Balance
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO WELLNESS | Yoga\, Art Therapy\, Meditation\, Chakra\n**Vipassana Meditation & Pranayama \\| Clear Mind & Emotional Balance**\n\nDive into a moment of inner calm and recentring. Join this online session and practice with me a combination of pranayama and Vipassana meditation to clear your mind and harmonize your emotions. An experience accessible to everyone\, in a supportive and guided space.\n\n**Why join?**\n• 🌟 **Mental clarity:** Learn to observe your thoughts without judgment and release accumulated stress.\n• 🌬️ **Vital energy:** Re-energize your body and mind with targeted breathing techniques.\n• 🌊 **Emotional balance:** Achieve a state of serenity in the face of daily challenges through better emotional management.\n• 🧘‍♂️ **Presence and grounding:** Enhance your ability to fully live in the present moment.\n• 🌍 **Accessibility:** A guided online practice\, open to everyone\, with no prior experience required.\n\n**Prepare your space for an optimal experience**\n• Choose a quiet place\, free from distractions.\n• Use a yoga mat or meditation cushion for added comfort.\n• Keep a bottle of water nearby.\n• Turn off notifications to fully immerse yourself in this moment for yourself.\n• Optional: Light a natural incense (white sage\, palo santo\, patchouli\, etc.).\n\n**Session outline**\n\n1. **Introduction & Pranayama:** Simple breathing techniques to prepare the body and mind for meditation.\n2. **Vipassana explanation & instructions:** A brief overview of Vipassana principles and practice guidelines.\n3. **Guided practice:** Immerse yourself in a supportive and nurturing meditation experience.\n4. **Discussion & Q&A:** An open space to ask questions and share your experience.\n\n**Practical information**\n• **Platform:** Zoom (link provided with the event).\n• **Access:** The waiting room opens 15 minutes before the start and remains accessible up to 5 minutes after the session begins. After this time\, access will no longer be possible to preserve the quality of the group experience.\n\n**Session led by Ludovic\, YE Master**\nTake this time for yourself. Your journey to a peaceful mind begins here. 🌟\n\n**✨ Join Our Wellness Community**\nThis session is your gateway to deeper guidance. Continue your journey with:\n\nMore on [https://www.yogasource.org](https://www.yogasource.org)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-wellness-yoga-art-therapy-meditation-chakra/events/313712494/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260309T151643Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260309T151643Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
