SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Teen Paint Lab
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260330T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260330T210000Z
UID:698623954dacf581ff7987de@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and get creative! Paint your own artwork in a relaxed\
 , no pressure space where experimentation is encouraged. Try new technique
 s\, mix colours\, and explore your ideas at your own pace. Whether you're 
 new to painting or love making art\, use this time to unwind\, express you
 rself\, and have fun. All supplies will be provided. Just drop by and star
 t painting.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a w
 elcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful st
 aff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop
  by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Cedarbrae\, Youth Hub\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/698623954dacf581ff7987de
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
