DESCRIPTION:In this part of the Blender 3D Fundamentals Series\, participa
 nts will learn how to use and understand 3D animation tools such as armatu
 res\, keyframes\, the dopesheet and graph editor to bring their 3D model t
 o life.\nRegistration is required. Computers will provided for this class.
 \nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is
