UID:693f0b1b4be11d3d00d817b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids and have
  fun! Drop-in\, space is limited.\nMarch 25: Fun with Dash\nApril 1: Conne
 ct 4 and UNO Tournaments\nApril 8: Snap Circuits\nSnacks are offered durin
 g the After School Club for participants.\nFood may contain or have come i
 nto contact with common allergens. Ingredient lists will be available. Sna
 cks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.
