SUMMARY:⛰️ 🛫 ITALY (the Alps of Trentino) Hiking Trip Presentation – WED\, Apr 8
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\n⭐️⭐️ Join our ONLINE event to chat about our guided hiking adventure in the spectacular mountains of Trentino (Italy) this summer (July 2026) ⭐️⭐️\nGrab your favorite beverage and log on to our online event to introduce you to our upcoming trip to the **Val di Sole** region of the **Alps**\, in the province of Trentino. Connect with your host – **Walter De Marco** (hike leader and Meetup organizer) and other attendees for this informative and interactive presentation.\n\n⭐️ Online registration via **Eventbrite** required to attend. ⭐️\n\n⭐️ **TOUR DETAILS** ⭐️\n**Dates: July 25–31\, 2026** • 7 Days / 6 Nights\n**Difficulty level:** Beginner/ Intermediate (some hiking experience required)\n\n• **Price:** From EUR 1\,550.00 pp\nFlight NOT incl.\n\n⭐️⭐️ **[>> Learn more HERE <<](https://www.meetup.com/hikingnetwork/events/313243928/)**\n\n⭐️⭐️ **[Please\, CLICK HERE](https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/1984780698498/)** to register for our FREE EVENT via **Eventbrite.** ⭐️⭐️
