DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T193000
UID:3c872387fa4b6e56103f6236dfacd749@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:We are excited to welcome Italian guest conductor Giovanni Pom
 peo\, and welcome back one of the orchestra's favourite piano soloists\, A
 nya Alexeyev\, to present a program of maximum Romantic melody. \n\nAnya s
 tars as the soloist in an orchestral version of César Franck's luxurious 
 Piano Quintet\, and Maestro Pompeo will lead the orchestra in one of the m
 ost beloved Romantic works in the entire repertoire\, Tchaikovsky's famous
  Serenade.\nCategories: Live Performances\, Music
