DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260410T210000Z
UID:69a21f8e1c129a205bcd67d6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Take a journey into the mysteries of magical illusions. Local 
 magician Ayan Deb explores the science and art of deception and illusion. 
 In this interactive workshop\, participants will enjoy and watch a series 
 of the newest tricks in the world of magic. Participants will also get a c
 hance to learn some simple\, yet astonishing magic tricks using everyday o
 bjects.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welco
 ming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff 
 are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop b
 y a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
