X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Knitters Guild": "https://torontoknittersguild.ca/event/arne-carlos-are-coming-back-to-toronto/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:knitters_guild
X-SOURCE:Toronto Knitters Guild
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260411T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260411T220000
DTSTAMP:20260316T021550
CREATED:20260205T151408Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260301T061052Z
UID:9893-1775934000-1775944800@torontoknittersguild.ca
SUMMARY:ARNE & CARLOS are coming back to Toronto!
DESCRIPTION:Sit and Knit for a Bit LIVE with Arne & Carlos\nThe Toronto Knitters Guild is thrilled to welcome the iconic Norwegian design duo ARNE & CARLOS for an unforgettable evening of knitting\, creativity\, and connection.\nTicket holders gain access to: \n\nAn exclusive lecture and evening social with Arne & Carlos\n15% Off In-Store at Toronto’s must-visit LYS\, The Knitting Loft\nGiveaway opportunities sponsored by The Knitting Loft and Estelle Yarns\n\nJoin us for an engaging and connective night with ARNE & CARLOS\, where you’ll be invited into their creative universe as they share their stories\, inspiration\, colour\, tradition\, and the slow evolution of their designs. \nThis is not a class — it’s an experience. Knit or crochet along as you listen\, laugh\, and soak in their ideas in an atmosphere that feels more like a cozy gathering than a formal lecture. \nThe evening continues with an exclusive meet-and-greet\, where you’ll have time for conversation\, questions\, and personal interaction with ARNE & CARLOS. \nEvent Details \n\nWhen: Saturday\, April 11\, 2026 | 7:00–10:00 PM\nWhere: George Brown Culinary School | 290 Adelaide Street E. Toronto\, ON | Auditorium SJC 406\n\nFor $75\, ticket holders receive: \n\n3-Hour Event Access to Lecture and Exclusive Arne & Carlos Meet & Greet\n15% Off at The Knitting Loft (In-Store Only April 10th – April 12th)\nOpportunities to win sponsored door prizes from The Knitting Loft and Estelle Yarns\n\n\nTickets are first come\, first serve with limited seating and high demand! \nBe sure to grab your tickets while they’re available\, as this is a rare opportunity to spend an evening with two of the most influential designers of today’s fibre world\, \nThe event takes place at the stylish\, fully accessible Auditorium SJC406 at George Brown Culinary School in Toronto’s historic Old Town — a bright\, comfortable venue with tables for your work and easy access by transit or car.\n\nSpace is limited\, and demand will be high. \n\n\nA Design & Inspiration Evening with ARNE & CARLOS\nSaturday\, April 11\, 2026 | 7:00–10:00 PM\n$75.00 CAD per person\nGeorge Brown Culinary School\nAuditorium SJC 406\n290 Adelaide Street East\, Toronto\, Ontario\n\n\n\n\nSECURE YOUR SPOT\n  \n*No ticket refunds after March 11\, 2026. Tickets may be transferred to another attendee after that date by sending an email no later than April 4th to info@torontoknittersguild.ca providing ticket confirmation number and name and email address of transferee.
URL:https://torontoknittersguild.ca/event/arne-carlos-are-coming-back-to-toronto/
LOCATION:George Brown Culinary School\, 290 Adelaide Street East\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5A 1N1\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Special Events,tkg event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://toronto-knitters-guild.sfo3.digitaloceanspaces.com/Arne-and_Carlos-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
