DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260411T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260411T213000
SUMMARY:オーガナイザー送別会
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Japanese English Exchange (TJEX.ca)\nFarewell Event for Organizer Rinka / オーガナイザーRinkaさんの送別会\n\nThis event is a farewell gathering for our organizer\, Rinka. As this will be Rinka’s final TJEX Meetup\, anyone who has attended at least one TJEX event and would like to express their gratitude or send their best wishes to Rinka is welcome to join.\n\nLocation: Firkin on Yonge (207 Yonge St.)\nDate: Saturday\, April 11th\nTime: 7:30 PM\nThere is no participation fee for TJEX. However\, in order to support the restaurant\, we kindly ask that all attendees order at least one item.\n\nAccess:\nApproximately a 1-minute walk from TTC Queen Station (Line 1).\nPlease exit Queen Station from the Shuter Street exit and walk south. The restaurant will be just ahead.\n\nDue to the venue capacity\, the number of reservations is limited. If you wish to attend\, please reserve your spot as soon as possible.\n\nParticipation in TJEX events is voluntary. By attending the event\, you agree that TJEX will not be responsible for any incidents or issues that may occur during the event.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please feel free to contact the organizer.\nWe look forward to seeing you!\n\nTJEX Organizers\n\nこのイベントはオーガナイザーRinkaさんの送別会です。\n今回がRinkaさんにとって最後のTJEX Meetupとなります。過去にTJEXイベントへ1回以上参加されたことがあり、Rinkaさんへ感謝の気持ちやエールを送りたい方はどなたでもご参加いただけます。\n\n場所: Firkin on Yonge（207 Yonge St.）\n日時: 4月11日（土）19:30\n\n参加費:\nTJEXへの参加費はありません。\nただし、お店をサポートするため、必ず何か最低でも1品ご注文いただくようお願いいたします。\n\n行き方:\nTTC Queen Station（ライン1）から徒歩約1分。\nQueen StationのShuter Street出口から出て南へ進むとお店があります。\n会場の都合により、予約人数に制限があります。参加をご希望の方はお早めにご予約ください。\n\nTJEXイベントへの参加はご自身の意思によるものとし、イベント中に発生したいかなるトラブルや事故についても、TJEXは責任を負いかねますのでご了承ください。\nご不明な点がございましたら、お気軽に\n\nオーガナイザーまでお問い合わせください。\n皆様にお会いできるのを楽しみにしております！\n\nTJEX Organizer
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/tjex-ca/events/313783439/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260315T145127Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260315T145127Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/f/d/3/600_523296819.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"City of Toronto Festivals & Events": "https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/clyde%E2%80%99s"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Clyde’s
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260411T193000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260426T140000
UID:52d9da629bf1965805870be15ab75450@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:In this kitchen\, redemption is always on the menu\n\nClyde ru
 ns a truck stop sandwich shop\, staffed by ex-convicts looking for a shot 
 at redemption. Despite her callous management style\, the cooks learn to r
 eclaim their lives\, find purpose\, and become inspired to dream by their 
 shared quest to create the perfect sandwich. A buoyant play full of witty 
 dialogue\, Clyde’s is a transcendent story about second chances\, rising
  above past mistakes\, and reconnecting with the world.  \n\nFull of sizzl
 ing wit\, big heart\, and mouthwatering ambition\, Clyde’s serves up a t
 hrilling\, high-energy ride—think The Bear meets Broadway. Helmed by ret
 urning director Philip Akin (The Lehman Trilogy\, Fat Ham)\, an all-star C
 anadian cast takes on this deliciously funny and deeply moving play. \nCat
 egories: Live Performances\, Theatre
LOCATION:Bluma Appel Theatre\, 27 Front St E\, Toronto\, ON\, M5E 1B4
URL:https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/clyde%E2%80%99s
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
