SUMMARY:Sunday Snap Circuits
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T180000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260412T190000Z
UID:69af1e40491b809c6f1f3827@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun afternoon of Snap circuits! Play with e
 lectricity and circuitry during this hands-on program! Turn on a light\, s
 pin a motor\, activate a speaker and choose from hundreds of different pro
 jects!\nRegistration is required. For ages 7-12 only (children outside of
  this age range will not be able to participate).\n*For all registered Chi
 ldren's programs at Malvern\, there is a grace period of 10 minutes. After
