SUMMARY:The Sea Star Ball with Dance Lesson\, Cocktails+++ at Ripley's Aquarium
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday\, April 17th**\, attend the **Sea Star Ball when Ripley's Aquarium will host its Regency-inspired Spring Ball\, an affair where elegance reigns and the ocean provides a most enchanting backdrop**. For one glittering night of revelry and romance\, the Aquarium's galleries will be transformed into a setting worthy of the Ton. Guests are encouraged to don their finest attire as they promenade through shimmering aquatic exhibits\, take dance lessons among the stingrays and sip on custom cocktails at their tropical reefs. **Purchase Sea Star Ball on Friday April 17th at 8pm.**\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Free Photo-ops\n* Surprise Giveaways\n* Whisky Lounge\n* Group Dance Lessons – Waltz\n* PLUS - Present yourself to the Queen of the Seven Seas!\n\n**COST**\nAdult: $62.50 + taxes\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sales are final\, no refunds or exchanges.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes** **\\- everyone goes on the waitlist until they post they purchased their ticket**\n* **[Purchase](https://www.ripleys.com/attractions/ripleys-aquarium-of-canada?promocode=SS26&utm_source=email&mc_cid=4ca30fd150&mc_eid=b8988f8b09)** **your own ticket and select the Sea Star Ball**\, post you have your ticket and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior and the Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 8pm inside the entrance of the Ripley's Aquarium at** **288 Bremner Boulevard.**\n\n**We will then head off for some sight seeing prior to joining the lessons\, etc.**\n\nLength: until 12am\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the Event after.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/experiencetoronto/events/313650839/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260305T160905Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260305T160905Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/f/d/3/600_533048147.jpeg
END:VEVENT
