DESCRIPTION:Same Race. Same Community. New Streets.\n\nThe Under Armour To
 ronto 10K is moving to the heart of the city and taking over the downtown 
 core. Starting and finishing at Nathan Phillips Square\, this isn’t just
  a 10K. It’s a day to show up\, race hard\, and move together. This race
  is all about the streets\, the pace\, and the community that makes it unf
 orgettable.\n\nRegistration is open now. See link below.\nCategories: Fami
 ly/Children\, Run/Walk
