SUMMARY:Time to learn New Skills - Trecking Training  - Two Day Hike with Full Gear
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeet up Point: 6700 Salmon Lake Road\, Sydenham\, ON K0H 2T0\, Canada\n**Two days...sat and sun**\n**Fee for Trekking Training: $99.**\n\nWe have a secret and an agenda. We want you (and all our members) out Treking. At least once. Don't give up your Sunday hikes\, but hey it's time to up your hiking game!\nWhich is why we are offering skills training for future trekkers so they can join in on trekking adventures outside of Ontario.\nThere is a lot to learn to prepare for a multi day trekk\, and we want you to be prepared. It is not just knowing what equipment to buy\, how much to carry\, tent set up\, it's also food prep\, attitude\, and emergency skills and so much more!\nSo\, in order for you to ensure you have a safe and the very BEST trekking experience we are offering a day in Big Salmon Lake.\n**Experienced Boots Trekkers feel free to hop in and show them how it's done!**\nWe will cover in one weekend -\n\n* your weighted pack\n* pack pacing\n* water filtering\n* trail etiquette\n* safety\n* equipment must haves\n* first aid\n* attittude adjustment\n* fire starting\n* navigation\n* ...and more\n\nA zoom call will happen **Thurs. March 19** where we share what you need to bring and answer your questions. Zoom details are coming.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/events/313749628/
