X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Toronto Postgres": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-postgres/events/311976671/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_postgres_to
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Postgres
UID:event_311976671@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260316T061713Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260421T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260423T200000
SUMMARY:Postgres Conference: 2026!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Postgres\nThe one\, the only\, [Postgres Conference!](https://postgresconf.og/)\n\n* **[Call for Paper open until Friday\, January 30. 2026](https://postgresconf.org/conferences/postgresconf_2026/program/proposals/new)**\n\nSince 2007\, Postgres Conference has been the destination for connecting with the Postgres Ecosystem in North America. Join us for a three day event which includes training\, breakout sessions and tutorials. Tracks include:\n\n* **Postgres Extensions Day:** Do you develop Postgres Extensions?\nDo you want to develop Postgres Extensions?\nThis day/track is for you!\n* **Dev:** All about developing with PostgreSQL. This can be about using extensions like pg_vector to increase your search performance to how to write a new data type.\n* **Ops:** Talks on the operational practices of Postgres and related technologies.\n* **Essentials:** Datatypes\, How do I and data types oh my! If it is in the docs\, or should be an isn't... this is where you elaborate on all the glory that is Postgres Essentials. Do not overlook this track it is job security.\n* **Life and Fun:** Nothing about Postgres goes here. Do you want to talk about your beehive\, backyard garden\, homestead\, solar\, latest IoT project\, mountain biking or camping? This is the place.\n* **Professional Development & Wellness:** Career enhancement\, dealing with burnout and the false ideal of a work life balance. This is where you find peers to help with all kinds of life problems and opportunities.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-postgres/events/311976671/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20251112T175210Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251112T175210Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/c/3/e/600_531267710.jpeg
END:VEVENT
