UID:698b6f262a787a47a5e700b2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Coach Shelly Campbell teaches participants how to use conversa
 tional writing in poetry to create imaginative work that is grounded in em
 otional truth\, precise vocabulary and lived experience.
