SUMMARY:Chess Club
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260422T203000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260422T213000Z
UID:69b41e75b48451fc3c08a235@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun after-school activity? Join our Youth Chess 
 Program to learn new skills\, play matches\, and connect with others! Pres
 ented by the University of Toronto Scarborough Campus (UTSC) Chess Club.\n
 This program is open to youth ages 7-17 years old.\nNo registration requir
 ed. Space is limited.
LOCATION:Port Union
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b41e75b48451fc3c08a235
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
