DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260427T210000Z
UID:6995e49f8089f23c675c73f8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come and play a game of ping pong with your friends! All equip
 ment will be provided.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth H
 ubs are a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where
  helpful staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered
  daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find ou
 t more.
LOCATION:York Woods\, Youth Hub
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6995e49f8089f23c675c73f8
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
