UID:699e4509403a4e5652dd5ff8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us after school for some fun activities\, such as STEM\, 
 arts & crafts\, and more!\nIn this program\, we'll be reusing old books\, 
 magazines and comics to make art!\nDrop-in. No registration required. Ages
  6-12.\nP.S. We can always provide Perler Beads as secondary activity opti
 on.
