X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Boba Making with Chef Yumiko
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T200000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T210000Z
UID:69ab5c21ec71a31f5b423812@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this 45 minute to 1 hour workshop\, participants will learn
  how to prepare a classic milk bubble tea\, including decorating and mixin
 g techniques\, as well as the breakdown of core ingredients. A classic lid
 ded cup and straw will be provided to enjoy the boba as you go!\n(*contain
 s dairy)\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welc
 oming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff
  are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop 
 by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Cedarbrae\, Youth Hub\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ab5c21ec71a31f5b423812
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library
END:VEVENT
