X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_events
SUMMARY:Swallowing Clouds Arts & Drama Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T203000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260507T220000Z
UID:69ac8d3d19c54125aa02ba1f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join professional artists in a fun and exciting community base
 d arts program for children. This workshop offers an introduction into the
  enriching world of art and creativity through Poetry\, Music\, Theatre an
 d Visual Arts.\nFor children ages 6-9.\nSpace is limited\, registration i
 s required. Attendees must be able to attend all four sessions of the work
 shop.
