BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"City of Toronto Festivals & Events": "https://www.rcmusic.com/events-and-performances/brad-mehldau-with-kirill-gerstein"}
X-SOURCE-ID:toronto_festivals
SUMMARY:Brad Mehldau with Kirill Gerstein
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260508T200000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-04:00";VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260508T200000
UID:98da9af17eea4a5bc176a70151785145@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Classical music and jazz collide as two of today’s most prol
 ific and compelling pianists join forces to create a unique program featur
 ing jazz exploration\, classical romanticism\, and pop allure.\n\nGrammy A
 ward-winning jazz pianist Brad Mehldau has recorded and performed extensiv
 ely since the early 1990s. He is first and foremost an improviser and grea
 tly cherishes the surprise and wonder that can occur from a spontaneous mu
 sical idea that is expressed directly\, in real time. But he also has a de
 ep fascination for the formal architecture of music\, and it informs every
 thing he plays. The two sides of Mehldau’s personality – the improvise
 r and the formalist – play off each other\, and the effect is often some
 thing like controlled chaos. \n\nKirill Gerstein has established himself a
 s one of today’s most prolific and compelling performers. \nCategories: 
 Arts/Exhibits\, Live Performances\, Music
LOCATION:Koerner Hall\, Royal Conservatory of Music\, 273 Bloor St W\, Tor
 onto\, ON\, M5S 1W2
URL:https://www.rcmusic.com/events-and-performances/brad-mehldau-with-kiri
 ll-gerstein
X-SOURCE:City of Toronto Festivals & Events
END:VEVENT
