SUMMARY:Mangiare\, Hike\, Repeat 
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**Ciao Bella!** For our first international trip of the year - we have are heading to ITALY to trekk the dolomites or hike and tour Italy.\n**JULY 11 - July 19**\nThis works in two ways - 2 groups\, 2 paths. Because not everyone wants to trekk for four days\, and because we are a large group we always offer two ways to come with us\, because well we just want you to experience the best trips and a lot of fun!\n\nSO.....\n1\\. You can sign up for the Trekking portion \\- 4 days\\\, 3 nights\\\, hut to hut on the full Val Di Fassa trail plus two day hikes on the Thursday and Friday in the dolomite region hiking\nOR\n2\\. A 7 day tour where we experience day hikes\\\, and Italy's dolomite village life\\. We will spending our time in the Dolomites and Venice for the 7 days enjoying day hikes and hitting iconic dolomite spots along with Venice night life and mountain night life\\. We will have lunch at the refugio and either the beginning or the end we will hike with the trecking group\\.\n\nAll details\, such as the costs\, itinerary\, exact fly in and out cities and meetup points will be supplied in the zoom call below. From there those who commit to the trip are then moved to a whats app where we follow the nitty gritty details of everyones flight bookings\, gear\, and flag ongoing questions\, and ensure you are well prepared and organized for this trip)\n\nIf you miss the zoom call you miss the trip.\n**ZOOM CALL: January 28\, 7:30 PM**\n**Meeting ID: 922 573 6911**\n**Passcode: crCjL3**\n**https://us05web.zoom.us/j/9225736911?pwd=QW5DamFQV0c5VDJjSis0eGxQZEk4QT09&omn=84536132265**\n**Join instructions**\n**https://us05web.zoom.us/meetings/84536132265/invitations?signature=ZguA6WuO-K4lE9JeXuA_-M5pdYFisBO0dsUEwTmDNgo**
