SUMMARY:Niagara Falls! Here we come by BIKE!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\n**MEETUP POINT: Burlington Go Station**\nJoin us for an all day bike riding event from Burlington Go to Niagara Falls and back. Total length of ride is 100km\, so obviously this is not a beginner ride.\nPlease ensure you are bike ready so take your bike out and start practicing in the spring to get yourself in good shape for this ride! I will post some practice rides starting in May and June\nNo commuter bikes please.\nYou will catch the go train nearest you which is $10. and take it to the Burlington Go station which we will all meet -time to be confirmed\, and begin our ride from there.\nLunch will be in Niagara Falls. Ensure you bring power snacks and water with lots of electrolytes!\n[https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53737914](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/53737914)
